    "detailed_description": "In this gloomy and mystifying first-person 2.5D horror survival game, help Sherlock Holmes chase down the murderous Count Dracula, who haunts the city of Rome every night, in order to kill and devour.<br />\r\nYou wake up as Sherlock Holmes in a hospital in Rome. Walk around old buildings, rooms, and alleys; inspect objects, store them in your inventory to use them later; have dialogues with people; try to escape the malevolent creatures and ghosts that cross your path, and try to find Count Dracula to make sense of your strange surroundings. All that just so that you wake up back in the hospital where you started. And you can't help the feeling, that something is very wrong about this...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFilled with tension, occasional jump scares and pure horror, you will be less and less able to tell dream from reality, and get lost in this world of creepy hand-drawn 2D animations!",
    "about_the_game": "In this gloomy and mystifying first-person 2.5D horror survival game, help Sherlock Holmes chase down the murderous Count Dracula, who haunts the city of Rome every night, in order to kill and devour.<br />\r\nYou wake up as Sherlock Holmes in a hospital in Rome. Walk around old buildings, rooms, and alleys; inspect objects, store them in your inventory to use them later; have dialogues with people; try to escape the malevolent creatures and ghosts that cross your path, and try to find Count Dracula to make sense of your strange surroundings. All that just so that you wake up back in the hospital where you started. And you can't help the feeling, that something is very wrong about this...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFilled with tension, occasional jump scares and pure horror, you will be less and less able to tell dream from reality, and get lost in this world of creepy hand-drawn 2D animations!",
    "short_description": "In this gloomy and mystifying first-person 2.5D horror game, help Sherlock Holmes chase down the murderous Count Dracula in the city of Rome! Over 7 nights, survive the unfolding nightmare in this world of creepy hand-drawn animations!",
