        "notes": "In this game, you will see a body dismembered occasionally. You will see a person with a horrified look, and blood and intestines flowing out their body. You will see a person being attacked and ripped apart by Dracula the monster. You will see Dracula drink and slurp the blood from people. These depictions will be animated in a Cartoon style, but can still be very disturbing. In one scene you will see a ghost figure throw themselves off a cliff."
